      "writtenOn": "2020-06-25T01:53:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "apex.use_vendor is used by com.android.media.swcodec and its main purpose is to use literally vendor variants for the sake of reducing the size. We do not allow other apexes to use the property(use_vendor). Even though swcodec apex uses vendor variants, it will run on across many API levels (from Q and later). Because swcodec apex packages most dependencies (VNDK libs) within it, it is built against \"platform vndk version\". It doesn\u0027t have to use \"board vndk version\".",
      "parentUuid": "0322297e_031d5d11",
